1. SCOPE OF PROTECTION

This license applies to all content in this repository and everything derived
from it, including but not limited to:

  a) source code, scripts, configurations, data structures, and database
     schemas;
  b) documentation, guides, runbooks, and wiki content;
  c) ARCHITECTURE, design patterns, methods, processes, and CONCEPTS
     expressed herein;
  d) graphic materials, UI text, and translations;
  e) compiled, built, or otherwise derived forms of the above.

The protection under item (c) is explicit: not only the textual expression
of the work is protected, but also the conceptual solution, architecture, and
method expressed therein. Reimplementing the same solution in your own code
or in a different programming language is equally prohibited.


2. RESTRICTIONS

Without the prior express written consent of the rights holder, you MAY NOT:

  a) reproduce, copy, or otherwise record the work or any part of it;
  b) distribute, share, publish, or make the work available to any third
     party, including free of charge;
  c) create derivative works, modify, or build upon the work;
  d) adopt the architecture, methods, processes, or concepts of the work in
     any other solution, even if the result is written in your own code;
  e) reverse engineer, decompile, or disassemble the work;
  f) use the work or any part of it to train, fine-tune, or evaluate machine
     learning or artificial intelligence systems;
  g) remove or alter any copyright or license notices.


3. PERMITTED USE — INTERNAL TEAM

  a) Employees, contractors, and authorized agents of IT Enterprise Solution
     s.r.o. may use the work solely for the purposes of IT Enterprise Solution
     s.r.o. and within the scope of their assigned permissions.


4. LIMITED LICENSE TO OPERATE A DEPLOYED INSTALLATION — CLIENT CLAUSE

  A customer to whom IT Enterprise Solution s.r.o. has deployed the work
  receives a non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable right to operate the
  specific deployed installation for their own internal use, for the duration
  of a valid contractual relationship with IT Enterprise Solution s.r.o.

  This right:
    - takes effect only on the date the contractual operation begins;
    - covers operation of the deployed installation only, not access to the
      source code or any copy thereof;
    - does not include any of the acts restricted in Section 2;
    - terminates immediately upon the end of the contractual relationship.

  Any other use requires a separate written agreement.

  ⚠️  The exact wording of the client clause and the scope of the licensed
      right should be reviewed by a solicitor — see the legal notice at the
      top of this file.


5. DEVELOPMENT PHASE — UNTIL 1 JANUARY 2027

  Until 1 January 2027 the work is in development and evaluation phase.
  During this period:

  a) it is not made available to customers for production use without the
     express written consent of IT Enterprise Solution s.r.o.;
  b) any installation at a third party is considered a trial; no warranty of
     availability, functionality, or support is given;
  c) IT Enterprise Solution s.r.o. may change, restrict, or take down the
     work at any time without prior notice.

  The client license under Section 4 takes effect no earlier than 1 January
  2027 and only under a concluded written agreement.


6. CONFIDENTIALITY — TRADE SECRET

  The work constitutes a trade secret of IT Enterprise Solution s.r.o.
  Anyone to whom it is disclosed is obliged to maintain confidentiality and
  protect it from access by third parties, including after the end of any
  collaboration or contractual relationship.


7. NO WARRANTY

  The work is provided "as is". IT Enterprise Solution s.r.o. makes no
  warranties and is not liable for any damage arising from the use of the
  work unless otherwise agreed in writing.


8. TERMINATION

  Any breach of an obligation under this license immediately and
  automatically terminates the permission granted, without notice. The
  confidentiality obligation under Section 6 survives termination.


9. GOVERNING LAW

  This license is governed by the laws of the Czech Republic. Disputes are
